OL,3,GNEWSASam Fender calls out ticket prices
OL,4,Aahead of tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Fender has called out the price of
OL,7,Fgig tickets ahead of his next tour,
OL,8,Fpromising to lower the cost.
OL,10,FThe 32-year-old announced his Proper
OL,11,FMassive Stadium Tour earlier this week,
OL,12,Fwhich will visit Newcastle, Cardiff,
OL,13,FLondon, Edinburgh, Dublin and
OL,14,FManchester in summer 2027.
OL,16,FWhile tickets are yet to go on sale,
OL,17,FFender responded to a post on social
OL,18,Fmedia which claimed to outline the
OL,19,Fexpected ticket prices.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
